(S + 5) + S + W = 339
2S + W + 5 = 339
2S + W = 334  ...(1)
From S = 4W − 13, solve for W:
W = (S + 13)/4  ...(2)
Substitute (2) into (1):
2S + (S + 13)/4 = 334
Multiply by 4:
8S + S + 13 = 1336
9S + 13 = 1336
9S = 1323
S = 147
