"Greta and Celinda are whipping up some cookies. Greta makes 30 cookies and Celinda makes twice that many. If they munch on 10 cookies while they're cooling off and stash the rest in a box, how many cookies are left in the box?","Greta and Celinda are baking cookies. Greta bakes 30 cookies and Celinda bakes twice as many. If the pair eat 10 of the cookies while they are cooling and put the rest in a box, how many cookies are there in the box?",80,80,80,80,"Step 1: Determine how many cookies Celinda makes.
